{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_17_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_17","textTraditional":"一、六年，春，正月，寔來。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_17_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_17","textTraditional":"寔來者，是來也。何謂是來？謂州公也。其謂之是來何也？以其畫我，故簡言之也。諸侯不以過相朝也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_17_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_17","textTraditional":"二、夏，四月，公會紀侯於郕。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_17_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_17","textTraditional":"三、秋，八月，壬午，大閱。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_17_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_17","textTraditional":"大閱者何？閱兵車也。脩教明諭，國道也。平而脩戎事，非正也。其日以為崇武，故謹而日之。蓋以觀婦人也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_17_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_17","textTraditional":"四、蔡人殺陳佗。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_17_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_17","textTraditional":"陳佗者，陳君也。其曰陳佗何也？匹夫行，故匹夫稱之也。其匹夫行奈何？陳侯喜獵，淫獵於蔡，與蔡人爭禽，蔡人不知其是陳君也，而殺之。何以知其是陳君也？兩下相殺，不道。其不地於蔡也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_17_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_17","textTraditional":"五、九月，丁卯，子同生。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_17_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_17","textTraditional":"疑，故志之。時曰同乎人也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_17_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_17","textTraditional":"六、冬，紀侯來朝。","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}